:"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidthPixels":357,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"We are interested in your attitudes towards Artificial Intelligence. By Artificial Intelligence w...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I am impressed by what Artificial Intelligence can do."},"2":{"Display":"Much of society will benefit from a future full of Artificial Intelligence."},"5":{"Display":"Artificial Intelligence can have positive impacts on people\u2019s wellbeing."},"6":{"Display":"Organisations use Artificial Intelligence unethically."},"9":{"Display":"I think Artificial Intelligence is dangerous."},"10":{"Display":"I shiver with discomfort when I think about future uses of Artificial Intelligence."},"11":{"Display":"I trust in Artificial Intelligences"},"12":{"Display":"I have trust in what Artificial Intelligences can produce"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,"5",2,"6","9","10","11","12"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"22":1,"23":2,"25":"3","27":"4","28":"5"},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Nous nous int\u00e9ressons \u00e0 vos attitudes envers l'Intelligence Artificielle. Par Intelligence Artificielle, nous entendons des appareils capables d'effectuer des t\u00e2ches qui n\u00e9cessiteraient g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement l'intelligence humaine. Veuillez noter qu'il peut s'agir d'ordinateurs, de robots ou d'autres dispositifs mat\u00e9riels, \u00e9ventuellement compl\u00e9t\u00e9s par des capteurs ou des cam\u00e9ras, etc. Veuillez compl\u00e9ter l'\u00e9chelle suivante en indiquant votre r\u00e9ponse pour chaque \u00e9nonc\u00e9.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Je suis impressionn\u00e9 par ce que l'Intelligence Artificielle peut faire."},"2":{"Display":"Une grande partie de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 va b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier d'un avenir rempli d'Intelligence Artificielle."},"5":{"Display":"L'Intelligence Artificielle peut avoir des impacts positifs sur le bien-\u00eatre des gens."},"6":{"Display":"Les organisations utilisent l'Intelligence Artificielle de mani\u00e8re non \u00e9thique."},"9":{"Display":"Je pense que l'Intelligence Artificielle est dangereuse."},"10":{"Display":"Je me sens mal \u00e0 l'aise quand je pense aux futures utilisations de l'Intelligence Artificielle.\u00a0"},"11":{"Display":"J'ai confiance dans les Intelligences Artificielles"},"12":{"Display":"J'ai confiance en ce que les Intelligences Artificielles peuvent produire"}},"Answers":{"22":{"Display":"Pas du tout d'accord"},"23":{"Display":"\u00a0"},"25":{"Display":"\u00a0"},"27":{"Display":"\u00a0"},"28":{"Display":"Tout \u00e0 fait d'accord"}}}},"NextChoiceId":13,"NextAnswerId":29,"Answers":{"22":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"23":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"25":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"27":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"28":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"AnswerOrder":["22","23","25","27","28"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":{"1":"ATT_AI _P1","2":"ATT_AI _P3","5":"ATT_AI _P2","6":"ATT_AI _N1","9":"ATT_AI _N2","10":"ATT_AI _N3","11":"ATT_TRUST_AI_11","12":"ATT_TRUST_AI_12"},"QuestionID":"QID128"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8CUhWGpvBbxkqoK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID131","SecondaryAttribute":"We are interested in your attitudes towards Artificial Intelligence. By Artificial Intelligence w...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We are interested in your attitudes towards Artificial Intelligence. By Artificial Intelligence we mean devices that can perform tasks that would usually require human intelligence. Please note that these can be computers, robots or other hardware devices, possibly augmented with sensors or cameras, etc. Please complete the following scale, indicating your response to each item. There are no right or wrong answers. We are interested in your personal views.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q131","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidthPixels":357,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"We are interested in your attitudes towards Artificial Intelligence. By Artificial Intelligence w...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I am impressed by what Artificial Intelligence can do."},"2":{"Display":"Much of society will benefit from a future full of Artificial Intelligence."},"5":{"Display":"Artificial Intelligence can have positive impacts on people\u2019s wellbeing."},"6":{"Display":"Organisations use Artificial Intelligence unethically."},"9":{"Display":"I think Artificial Intelligence is dangerous."},"10":{"Display":"I shiver with discomfort when I think about future uses of Artificial Intelligence."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,"5",2,"6","9","10"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"22":1,"23":2,"25":"3","27":"4","28":"5"},"GradingData":[],"Language":{"FR":{"QuestionText":"Nous nous int\u00e9ressons \u00e0 vos attitudes envers l'Intelligence Artificielle. Par Intelligence Artificielle, nous entendons des appareils capables d'effectuer des t\u00e2ches qui n\u00e9cessiteraient g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement l'intelligence humaine. Veuillez noter qu'il peut s'agir d'ordinateurs, de robots ou d'autres dispositifs mat\u00e9riels, \u00e9ventuellement compl\u00e9t\u00e9s par des capteurs ou des cam\u00e9ras, etc. Veuillez compl\u00e9ter l'\u00e9chelle suivante en indiquant votre r\u00e9ponse pour chaque \u00e9nonc\u00e9.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Je suis impressionn\u00e9 par ce que l'Intelligence Artificielle peut faire."},